  "description": "Mongoose was born from BMX race, and the latest Title series bikes have been designed using that same race pedigree. Designed for beginners or riders returning to the sport, the Mongoose Title 24 BMX-style race bike is a trophy-worthy cruiser at an amazingly affordable price.\nLightweight Tectonic T1 aluminum frame, integrated headset and internal cable routing for clean lines and added protection. 21.75\" top tube length and frame weight of 3.44 lbs.\nDrivetrain features 175mm 3-piece tubular chromoly cranks with a 42T chainring and euro cartridge bottom bracket.\nArisun XLR8 24\"x 1.75\" race tires mounted on Xposure aluminum double wall rims with aluminum ball bearing front hub and 18T cog freewheel rear hub.\nHi-Ten steel handlebar (6.5\") and fork, 48 mm stem, sealed bearing headset, and alloy V-brake and brake levers. Suggested rider height is 5'7\" and taller.",
